    {
      "id": "L-RHINE",
      "version": "frozen-20260913-v1",
      "type": "LINKED",
      "title": "我走了另一条路",
      "body": "今天爬山，旅伴们走得好快，我有点跟不上。\n\n想起你说过，累了可以歇一会，我就歇了一会儿。\n\n你猜我看到了什么？\n\n一条亮晶晶的河哎！我趴在那里看了好久好久。",
      "sha256": "02022589f17ccdf253be408cb67f9c5f79a047f822993ae72b62b5e063a31b81",
      "sourceReference": {
        "file": "有猫来信_W1核心体验样件与最小规则_V0.4.md",
        "sha256": "69fea3e1709316515a6ef5cadc6b32ad5d82cafbbd6239dc7322663f15ec905f",
        "section": "2.3"
      },
      "status": "INTERNAL_DRAFT",
      "claimRequirements": [
        "允许累时休息"
      ],
      "exclusions": [],
      "sceneId": "RHINE",
      "ordinaryFallbackId": "O-RHINE-01",
      "visualId": "internal-placeholder-v1",
      "narrativeSeason": null,
      "timeOfDay": "傍晚"
    },
    {
      "id": "L-FIREFLY",
      "version": "frozen-20260913-v1",
      "type": "LINKED",
      "title": "抱抱也是礼物",
      "body": "麻麻，今天路上遇到一只小猫，它的风筝坏掉了，坐在草地上不说话，看起来好难过。\n\n我不知道该说什么，就想起你说的，陪着就好啦，于是我就静静地坐在它旁边，喵呜~\n\n你猜后来怎么样啦？\n\n天慢慢黑了，草地上飞起好多萤火虫，它突然笑了，还摘了一片叶子送给我当礼物呢！\n\n我抱着那片叶子，好开心呀麻麻，因为那是它的心意呀~",
      "sha256": "f9856d0bc7366728d3b90d899381aa7f27049042afd0ae2f1f71d5fc16a83ae0",
      "sourceReference": {
        "file": "有猫来信_W1核心体验样件与最小规则_V0.4.md",
        "sha256": "69fea3e1709316515a6ef5cadc6b32ad5d82cafbbd6239dc7322663f15ec905f",
        "section": "3.3"
      },
      "status": "INTERNAL_DRAFT",
      "claimRequirements": [
        "陪伴表达关心",
        "心意的价值"
      ],
      "exclusions": [],
      "sceneId": "FIREFLY",
      "ordinaryFallbackId": "O-FIREFLY-01",
      "visualId": "internal-placeholder-v1",
      "narrativeSeason": "初夏",
      "timeOfDay": "夜晚"
    },
    {
      "id": "L-LIGHTHOUSE",
      "version": "frozen-20260913-v1",
      "type": "LINKED",
      "title": "灯塔亮起来的时候",
      "body": "今天走到海边，好多新朋友在追海浪，我一开始不敢过去。\n\n想起你说过，慢慢来就好，我就先站在旁边看了一会儿。\n\n你猜后来怎么样啦？\n\n灯塔亮起来啦！\n\n好多猫都围过来看，我也悄悄凑近了一点点，好暖呀～",
      "sha256": "308754bcb26785b7d4f7fec11b5700c08b7c609b9f73337cf5c8e1f75b638b99",
      "sourceReference": {
        "file": "有猫来信_W1核心体验样件与最小规则_V0.4.md",
        "sha256": "69fea3e1709316515a6ef5cadc6b32ad5d82cafbbd6239dc7322663f15ec905f",
        "section": "4.3"
      },
      "status": "INTERNAL_DRAFT",
      "claimRequirements": [
        "面对新伙伴允许观察和慢慢来"
      ],
      "exclusions": [],
      "sceneId": "LIGHTHOUSE",
      "ordinaryFallbackId": "O-LIGHTHOUSE-01",
      "visualId": "internal-placeholder-v1",
      "narrativeSeason": null,
      "timeOfDay": "傍晚"
    },
    {
      "id": "O-RHINE-01",
      "version": "frozen-20260913-v1",
      "type": "ORDINARY",
      "title": "山下面有一条亮亮的河",
      "body": "麻麻，今天走到山上啦！\n\n风把旁边的叶子吹得哗啦哗啦，我往下面一看——有一条好长好长的河，亮得像一条带子。\n\n河上还有小船慢慢走，我趴着看了好久，差点忘记肚子饿了喵~",
      "sha256": "af92db42e49dafb2bb0e28318287dda9072b20590773ddfe0beb9c4adddf659b",
      "sourceReference": {
        "file": "有猫来信_W1-G原型内容补齐_V0.1.md",
        "sha256": "030e7ee5ecc3a132d3065a3439f38894b8f6a708f8ce0bef2dfa9a4db988bd0d",
        "section": "O-RHINE-01"
      },
      "status": "INTERNAL_DRAFT",
      "claimRequirements": [],
      "exclusions": [],
      "sceneId": "RHINE",
      "ordinaryFallbackId": null,
      "visualId": "internal-placeholder-v1",
      "narrativeSeason": null,
      "timeOfDay": "傍晚"
    },
    {
      "id": "O-FIREFLY-01",
      "version": "frozen-20260913-v1",
      "type": "ORDINARY",
      "title": "好多小星星飞起来啦",
      "body": "麻麻，今天晚上我去了一片安安静静的草地。\n\n天刚黑的时候，旁边忽然一闪、一闪，我还以为是谁在眨眼睛呢！\n\n后来好多萤火虫一起飞起来啦，像小星星掉到草地里。我坐着都不敢乱动，怕把它们吓跑喵~",
      "sha256": "01582d33ae056157f8716fabdb95cd16e4ddb3a09661bffb4cd16c6d3cfac878",
      "sourceReference": {
        "file": "有猫来信_W1-G原型内容补齐_V0.1.md",
        "sha256": "030e7ee5ecc3a132d3065a3439f38894b8f6a708f8ce0bef2dfa9a4db988bd0d",
        "section": "O-FIREFLY-01"
      },
      "status": "INTERNAL_DRAFT",
      "claimRequirements": [],
      "exclusions": [],
      "sceneId": "FIREFLY",
      "ordinaryFallbackId": null,
      "visualId": "internal-placeholder-v1",
      "narrativeSeason": "初夏",
      "timeOfDay": "夜晚"
    },
    {
      "id": "O-LIGHTHOUSE-01",
      "version": "frozen-20260913-v1",
      "type": "ORDINARY",
      "title": "灯塔一闪一闪的",
      "body": "麻麻，今天海边的风超级大，我的耳朵一直被吹歪，哈哈！\n\n天慢慢暗下来的时候，远远的灯塔亮起来啦，一下一下照到海上。\n\n我和旁边几只猫一起抬头看了好久。海黑黑的，灯却好亮呀喵~",
      "sha256": "d4faa3bba2e5a073765f2b7f6bf95987d5ddebaa0692f157e07635b41754cd0a",
      "sourceReference": {
        "file": "有猫来信_W1-G原型内容补齐_V0.1.md",
        "sha256": "030e7ee5ecc3a132d3065a3439f38894b8f6a708f8ce0bef2dfa9a4db988bd0d",
        "section": "O-LIGHTHOUSE-01"
      },
      "status": "INTERNAL_DRAFT",
      "claimRequirements": [],
      "exclusions": [],
      "sceneId": "LIGHTHOUSE",
      "ordinaryFallbackId": null,
      "visualId": "internal-placeholder-v1",
      "narrativeSeason": null,
      "timeOfDay": "傍晚"
    },
    {
      "id": "TIPS-01",
      "version": "frozen-20260913-v1",
      "type": "TIP",
      "title": "小提示 1",
      "body": "不一定要替它决定明天怎么办。也可以先让它知道：累了、想休息，本身就可以说出来。",
      "sha256": "d40c3b1e18e1a15feed81f08e75d0a6d119df850dc8ae78c0d2f04ead5976a05",
      "sourceReference": {
        "file": "有猫来信_W1-G原型内容补齐_V0.1.md",
        "sha256": "030e7ee5ecc3a132d3065a3439f38894b8f6a708f8ce0bef2dfa9a4db988bd0d",
        "section": "TIPS-01"
      },
