    },
    {
      "id": "TIPS-02",
      "version": "frozen-20260913-v1",
      "type": "TIP",
      "title": "小提示 2",
      "body": "它现在好像把“没抓到”跟“我很笨”连在一起了。你可以先陪它把这两件事分开。",
      "sha256": "66674333c2b003876216519068c21090c01beae6907fc5d1409cedd5946517a7",
      "sourceReference": {
        "file": "有猫来信_W1-G原型内容补齐_V0.1.md",
        "sha256": "030e7ee5ecc3a132d3065a3439f38894b8f6a708f8ce0bef2dfa9a4db988bd0d",
        "section": "TIPS-02"
      },
      "status": "INTERNAL_DRAFT",
      "claimRequirements": [],
      "exclusions": [],
      "sceneId": null,
      "ordinaryFallbackId": null,
      "visualId": "internal-placeholder-v1",
      "narrativeSeason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "TIPS-03",
      "version": "frozen-20260913-v1",
      "type": "TIP",
      "title": "小提示 3",
      "body": "它好像很在意：这份心意会不会被你喜欢。你可以先回应它的心意，不一定要评价礼物有没有用。",
      "sha256": "9f67fb42a49f56054ee7f30e967c346c1bfae0ea646c9eaa0ce2d90b766587c9",
      "sourceReference": {
        "file": "有猫来信_W1-G原型内容补齐_V0.1.md",
        "sha256": "030e7ee5ecc3a132d3065a3439f38894b8f6a708f8ce0bef2dfa9a4db988bd0d",
        "section": "TIPS-03"
      },
      "status": "INTERNAL_DRAFT",
      "claimRequirements": [],
      "exclusions": [],
      "sceneId": null,
      "ordinaryFallbackId": null,
      "visualId": "internal-placeholder-v1",
      "narrativeSeason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "TIPS-04",
      "version": "frozen-20260913-v1",
      "type": "TIP",
      "title": "小提示 4",
      "body": "安慰不一定要说出一句很厉害的话。有时候，认真陪在旁边也已经是在关心了。",
      "sha256": "643fa25997220a0ecbc3bfb0b3d53f2d8b968a73ef545c684d3325f5bce45be4",
      "sourceReference": {
        "file": "有猫来信_W1-G原型内容补齐_V0.1.md",
        "sha256": "030e7ee5ecc3a132d3065a3439f38894b8f6a708f8ce0bef2dfa9a4db988bd0d",
        "section": "TIPS-04"
      },
